      "text": {
        "en": "Dogs show genuine excitement when visiting this facility for daycare, boarding, and grooming. Reviewers frequently describe pups rushing to the door and eagerly pawing to enter the playrooms. Clients note that even nervous or shy pets quickly settle in, returning home happy, comfortably tired, and treated with consistent warmth by the daycare team."
