      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and accommodating care team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The team earns widespread praise from pet owners for attentive, accommodating, and friendly service. Staff members are commended for remembering individual dogs by name, providing welcoming check-ins, and handling urgent travel boarding requests with flexibility. Patrons appreciate the reassuring atmosphere created by dedicated caretakers."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
