      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean, comfortable, and secure facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently compliment the cleanliness, security, and comfortable layout of the facility. Unlike sterile warehouse daycares, the space is described as a cozy, welcoming environment designed to feel like a home setting. Pet parents appreciate the fresh-smelling rooms, secure entryways, and well-maintained indoor play spaces."
      }
    }
